* text=auto eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.config text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
mvnw text eol=lf
*.jar binary
*.tif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary

# The bundled calibration is frozen evidence, and its digests are checked on
# every build. Line-ending normalisation would change those digests on a fresh
# checkout, so these three files are stored byte for byte as they were copied
# out of the benchmark run that produced them. They are never edited: a better
# benchmark is a new file with a new date in its name.
src/main/resources/calibration/*.csv binary
